# Shipped Gruvbox default (install seed)

This directory is the **first-boot** theme: wallpaper, source color, and
pre-rendered app configs. Install copies these into machine-local paths.
`git-eod-pull` does **not** re-apply them once a live palette exists.

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `wallpaper.name` | `gruvbox_stripes_arch.png` (Arch logo / Gruvbox stripes) |
| `source-color` / `user-accent` | `#689d6a` |
| `palette.json` | Canonical gruvbox-dark base16 |
| `live/` | Gitignored app outputs (waybar, kitty, gtk, qt, …) |

Wallpaper pixels live in `assets/wallpapers/` (same image as
`default.png` and the theme-slot copy under
`home/.config/colorschemes/gruvbox-dark/wallpapers/`).

Matugen is optional after install (Waypaper / Super+W). Do not run it
from `install.sh` or `git-eod-pull`.
